Z||000005||Fformula88||12-03-2001||03:06 PM||||They do get out of hand.  I generally stay out of botht he kill forum and the "lounge".  The cars themselves are competant in their own right but starting to show their age against the power outputs of the lates sport coupes.<P>Their main hatred seems to focus on Civics.  Lots of respect there for the Eclipse... kinda like the Fiero people who respect the MR2.  It was the direct competitor.<P>I like the Probe a lot, although my SE only has the 4 cyl.  All the 93+ Probes have Mazda engines in them, which IMO is better than having the Ford Dura-crap engine like the Cougar got. <P>Another place to check is the Probe forums on  <A HREF="http://www.fordforums.com" TARGET=_blank>www.fordforums.com</A> .  Not as many people there, and some spill-over from probetalk but it'll get you more opinions.||||reg||1
